I bought my own ticket and got on the boat.
It was an old boat.
Even so, it was very beautiful.
I sat near the window.
Slowly, the boat started moving from the jetty.
It was a very slow-moving ferry.
There were large palm trees on both sides of the lake.
The boat moved smoothly between the thick trees.
It was very quiet there.
The sound of the water was very nice to hear.
Before noon, the summer heat was terrible.
But a nice breeze came from the water there.
That cool breeze finally broke the heavy heat.
I closed my eyes and enjoyed that breeze.
I completely forgot about the noisy city.
This boat trip was very peaceful.
